{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A news crew is abducted, Miniaturized and trapped in a machine that turns your memories into a prison. PALINGENESIS is an immersive puzzle adventure where environments react to the music, shifting and transforming with the pulse of an original 10-track album by GRIGS. Solve intricate challenges to escape the Human Wheel \u2014 a construct designed to keep you running while unknowingly generating energy for an alien fleet. Created entirely by acclaimed animator and musician John Paul Grigsby, this game fuses reactive visuals, problem-solving, and a haunting sci-fi narrative into a one-of-a-kind experience. Will you break free, or will you become just another source of power? Stream the album, PALINGENESIS wherever you listen to your music.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920040?t=1743573903","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743573903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920040/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743573903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920040/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743573903","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A news crew is abducted, Miniaturized and trapped in a machine that turns your memories into a prison. PALINGENESIS is an immersive puzzle adventure where environments react to the music, shifting and transforming with the pulse of an original 10-track album by GRIGS. Solve intricate challenges to escape the Human Wheel \u2014 a construct designed to keep you running while unknowingly generating energy for an alien fleet. Created entirely by accla